PASS: BOUNDED_POWER_OF_TWO_RING: fixed 2048-slot queue bounds memory and wrap mask is power-of-two
PASS: SEQUENCE_GENERATIONS_REPLACE_ABA_STACK: per-slot generations replace reclaimable head pointers
PASS: PRODUCER_RESERVATION_IS_ATOMIC: concurrent producers reserve unique queue positions
PASS: PRODUCER_RELEASE_PUBLICATION: consumer cannot observe a slot before pointer publication
PASS: QUEUE_FULL_IS_EXPLICIT: full queue is rejected without overwriting a live slot
PASS: CONSUMER_ACQUIRES_AND_RECYCLES_GENERATION: single consumer advances slot generation before reuse
PASS: SKBUFF_HAS_NO_INTRUSIVE_STACK_NODE: skb lifetime is no longer coupled to a reclaimed stack link
PASS: REAPER_DRAINS_BOUNDED_QUEUE: sole deferred consumer reclaims dequeued skbs
PASS: PRODUCER_ACCOUNTING_PRECEDES_PUBLICATION: outstanding count is visible before consumer can pop
PASS: QUEUE_FULL_ROLLS_BACK_OUTSTANDING: full queue rolls back outstanding before quarantine
PASS: PRODUCER_NEVER_FREES_OR_LOGS: closed/full paths do not perform synchronous IOFree
PASS: REAPER_WAKEUP_HANDSHAKE_RETAINED: producer arriving during drain cannot lose its wakeup
PASS: EXIT_RETURNS_FAILURE_IF_QUEUE_NOT_DRAINED: cleanup result is explicit to resource owners
PASS: COMPAT_HEADER_EXPOSES_BOOL_EXIT: callers must check teardown completion
PASS: TX_STATUS_CALLBACK_TRANSFERS_SKB: TX callback only publishes completion and transfers skb ownership
PASS: TX_STATUS_HAS_NO_LOCKED_DIAGNOSTIC_IO: one-shot completion remains while synchronous logging stays removed
PASS: MISSING_CALLBACK_FALLBACK_IS_DEFERRED: fallback also avoids synchronous free
PASS: LEGACY_STOP_PROPAGATES_TEARDOWN_FAILURE: legacy superclass stop is withheld when compat exit fails
PASS: LEGACY_TEARDOWN_RETAINS_MMIO_AND_PCI: legacy device does not release PCI/MMIO/DMA after failed reaper drain
PASS: LEGACY_FREE_QUARANTINES_OWNER: legacy object stays alive while compat runtime is retained
PASS: WCL_CLOSE_PROPAGATES_TEARDOWN_FAILURE: WCL close returns busy instead of success on failed compat exit
PASS: WCL_BACKEND_RETAINS_DMA_AND_LEASE: WCL PCI/DMA owner remains retained on failed compat drain
PASS: WCL_FREE_QUARANTINES_BACKEND: WCL backend is not destroyed after failed deferred drain
PASS: CONTROLLER_RETAINS_CHILD_ON_CLOSE_FAILURE: controller keeps backend and workloop owned
PASS: CONTROLLER_FREE_ALREADY_QUARANTINES: controller free path preserves parent lifetime on child failure
PASS: FULL_TX_STATUS_CALLBACK_HAS_ADMISSION_GATE: callback lifetime is counted before entering radio completion code
PASS: QUIESCE_CLOSES_GATE_AND_JOINS_ACTIVE_CALLBACKS: teardown waits until the entire synchronous status callback has returned
PASS: STATUS_DISPATCH_GATE_COVERS_COMPLETION_AND_SKB_ENQUEUE: the lease spans completion publication and final skb enqueue
PASS: COMPAT_EXIT_QUIESCES_CALLBACK_BEFORE_REAPER_DRAIN: no in-flight callback can enqueue after final thread-call join
PASS: LEGACY_RADIO_RELEASE_FOLLOWS_CALLBACK_QUIESCE: legacy radio object stays alive until all status callbacks return
PASS: WCL_CONTROLLER_IMPORTS_COMPAT_QUIESCE_API: WCL controller imports the quiescence declaration with C linkage
PASS: WCL_COMPLETION_WORKER_RELEASE_FOLLOWS_CALLBACK_QUIESCE: WCL token reaper/worker remains alive until the enclosing callback exits
